@inherits HowItWorksPageBase

<MudText><b>IOTZOO</b> works through the interaction of three parts:</MudText>
<MudText Style="text-indent: 1em;">1. The IOTZOO firmware on one or more ESP32 microcontrollers.</MudText>
<MudText Style="text-indent: 1em;">2. The IOTZOO service, which runs your rules. It runs on a web server. A Raspberry Pi with Docker can serve as the host.</MudText>
<MudText Style="text-indent: 1em;">3. An MQTT broker, which passes messages between all parts. The IOTZOO service includes its own broker, but you can also use an external broker such as Mosquitto.</MudText>
<br />
